8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\)</span> (formulas of construction depth at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d+1)}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\land\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d+1)}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\land\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(d)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists x\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi,\\\\\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists x\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi,\\\\\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> : S-公式集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> : 原子公式集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> : 签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 下的变量集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\)</span>是原始构造子；其余显示的联结词与存在量词是\n派生缩写。有限深度分层同时给出结构递归和归纳的良基依据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (symbol set, see [[88-df-symbol]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ (atomic-formula set, see [[88-df-atomic-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ (variable set, see [[88-df-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ : 原子公式集 (see [[88-df-atomic-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ : 签名 $S$ 下的变量集 (see [[88-d